# --- goalify's own state / generated briefs and conditions ---
# goalify writes implementation briefs and derived /goal conditions under .goal/ in
# a project. They are single-use and get archived to .goal/done/ on success; never
# commit them (they hold absolute paths and project-specific context). Keep this repo
# generic.
.goal/
*-goal.md
goal-*.md

